    "final": "Resolved the timeout failures in [requests/adapters.py](/testbed/requests/adapters.py:429).\n\n`NewConnectionError` is a subclass of `ConnectTimeoutError`, but the adapter previously excluded it from conversion to `requests.exceptions.ConnectTimeout`. The exclusion was removed so connection-phase failures now preserve the documented timeout exception type.\n\nExact required verification:\n\n```text\npython -m pytest test_requests.py::TestTimeout::test_connect_timeout \\\n                 test_requests.py::TestTimeout::test_total_timeout_connect -vv\n\n2 passed, 0 failed\n```\n\nThe binary request-body fix and regression test remain in place. The earlier full-suite run still has unrelated environment failures: `84 passed, 2 failed, 81 errors, 1 skipped`, primarily recursive `httpbin` fixture setup and unavailable network hosts.",
